+ * Every piece of text ctwm draws goes through these two Xlib calls on a
+ * MyFont's font_set, so redirecting them here gives every title, menu and
+ * label anti-aliased text without touching each caller.  A fontset that has
+ * no Xft font behind it goes to Xlib unchanged.  util.c holds the
+ * implementations, and #undef's these to reach the real calls.
